  "description": "Powerful Mid-Drive Performance with 238 Nm of Torque\n\nThe HT500 features a powerful 2500W mid-drive motor with up to 4000W peak power. Delivering 238 Nm of torque directly through the chain, it provides strong acceleration and confident performance on steep 30° climbs and challenging terrain.\nL1e-B Road Legal with COC Documentation\nThe HT500 comes with full COC documentation and is approved as an L1e-B electric moped for road use in the EU. Its twist throttle delivers a road-legal top speed of up to 45 km/h.\nAuthentic Motorcycle Riding Experience\nFixed foot pegs, a pedal-free design and motorcycle-grade tyres—19 inches at the front and 17 inches at the rear—provide stable handling, precise control and a genuine motorcycle feel on tarmac, gravel and off-road terrain.\nHydraulic Disc Brakes and Full Suspension\nPowerful hydraulic disc brakes deliver precise, reliable and fade-resistant stopping performance. The robust front fork and rear shock absorber help smooth out rough surfaces while improving comfort and control at higher speeds.\n1620Wh Removable Battery with 5A Fast Charger\nThe removable 60V 27Ah high-capacity battery provides 1620Wh of energy for longer commutes and extended rides. With the included 5A fast charger, a full charge takes approximately six hours.",
